    "created_at": "2021-07-28T12:29:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-28T12:29:04Z",
    "body": "Ah that is specified in another part of the spec. In [The rules for choosing a browsing context](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#the-rules-for-choosing-a-browsing-context-given-a-browsing-context-name), in step 8, section \"If the user agent has been configured such that in this instance it will create a new browsing context\", step 2, we will set noopener when trying to open a popup if the opener is not same-origin with the top-level document of a COOP same-origin page.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
