    "created_at": "2021-07-28T17:39:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-28T17:39:53Z",
    "body": "Oh, maybe it is due to this part of the spec:\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#creating-a-new-browsing-context (Step 12)\r\n\r\n> If creator is non-null and creator's origin is same origin with creator's relevant settings object's top-level origin, then set coop to creator's browsing context's top-level browsing context's active document's cross-origin opener policy.\r\n\r\nIn the previous test, I guess that means that the new popup has COOP=='unsafe-none', not COOP=='same-origin-allow-popups'. Is that right?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/888495215/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
