    "created_at": "2021-07-29T09:46:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-29T09:46:27Z",
    "body": "Yes that is the case. The initial document of the popup only inherits the COOP of the page of its creator if the creator is same-origin  with the top-level document. Otherwise, it has a COOP of unsafe-none. So when it navigates to a COOP page of same-origin-allow-popups, there is a browsing context group switch.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/888972122/reactions",
